# SHA-256 of build outputs that must match known-good images.
#
# Rivet v0.1.0 is XTIDE Universal BIOS v1.1.5 with only the ROM header
# identity changed: date, configuration-program signature, title and
# version strings. In all three images, every byte from offset 60h up to
# the checksum byte is identical to v1.1.5. The XT image was checked
# against the v1.1.5 factory-default release image, the AT image against
# configured v1.1.5 AT release images, and the XT+ image against the
# byte-exact v1.1.5 NASM build (commit 9133965).
#
# Any change to these hashes must come with an intended change to the ROM,
# made in the same commit, and the commit message must say why.
5968f327a0baf696c93a37a5df828990b4988046533e39f584938d1c783f3e37  Build/rivet_xt.bin
5ed9d7147e24b2b60e5c123e261abf854b87e952af9fd77ccae6245930534fac  Build/rivet_xtp.bin
f8f68026abd84800a609c883499e32544be5a1be044d86276c128d5fb0252a10  Build/rivet_at.bin
